#ASSERT NOT (`offence under s 323` `A swings at Z and misses`)
#ASSERT (`charge under s 323` `A swings at Z and misses`)'s text EQUALS ""
#ASSERT (`charge under s 323` `A swings at Z and misses`)'s refusal EQUALS "A charge under section 323 would assert that the facts fulfil every legal condition of voluntarily causing hurt (CPC s 123(5)). On the facts given they do not: does thereby cause hurt (bodily pain, disease, infirmity or unconsciousness - s 319) to any person; the elements of section 321 taken together."

