-- s 322 illus
#ASSERT `voluntarily causes grievous hurt` `s 322 illus`
#ASSERT `offence under s 325` `s 322 illus`
#ASSERT NOT (`offence under s 323A` `s 322 illus`)
#ASSERT (`charge under s 325` `s 322 illus`)'s text EQUALS "You, A, are charged that you, on or about the 1st day of January 2026, at Orchard Road, Singapore, did voluntarily cause grievous hurt to one Z, to wit, by giving the said Z a blow to the face, and you have thereby committed an offence punishable under section 325 of the Penal Code 1871."

