#ASSERT (`charge under s 354(2)` `A touches Z's breast`)'s refusal EQUALS "A charge under section 354(2) would assert that the facts fulfil every legal condition of assault or use of criminal force to a person below 14 years of age with intent to outrage modesty (CPC s 123(5)). On the facts given they do not: against any person below 14 years of age."

