#ASSERT (`charge under s 302(1)` `s 300 Exception 1 illus (b)`)'s refusal EQUALS "A charge under section 302(1) would assert that the facts fulfil every legal condition of murder (CPC s 123(5)). On the facts given they do not: the case is not within any of the Exceptions to section 300."

